 id:'intercom', name:'Intercom', color:'#B5C9FF', symbol:'↗', theme:'A smaller crew. A different kind of ship.',
 intro:'Intercom brings a broad customer-service platform. Orka brings your websites, people and knowledge into one approachable workspace. The right choice depends on how much infrastructure your support team actually needs.',
